# StockOS — Smart Inventory Management System

StockOS is an AI-powered inventory management platform designed to simplify and automate business operations. It centralizes inventory tracking, procurement, sales, supplier management, reporting, and stock monitoring into a single platform.

The system uses role-based access control to provide users with access to features relevant to their responsibilities. AI-powered insights through Groq help users understand inventory trends, identify stock-related issues, and make better replenishment decisions.

---

## Features

### Role-Based Access Control

StockOS supports different user roles with dedicated workflows and permissions.

#### Admin

- View overall business operations
- Monitor inventory statistics
- Access AI Assistant
- View audit trails
- Track stock movement
- Perform stock adjustments
- Manage users
- Access reports and analytics

#### Sales

- Create and manage sales orders
- Track order status
- Update inventory after sales
- View customer orders

#### Procurement

- Manage suppliers
- Create and manage purchase orders
- Track procurement orders
- Receive inventory
- Restock products

---

## Core Modules

### Inventory Dashboard

- Real-time inventory statistics
- Stock availability overview
- Low-stock monitoring
- Inventory performance metrics
- Sales and procurement summaries
- Interactive charts and analytics

### Inventory Management

- Product management
- Category management
- SKU management
- Product search and filtering
- Real-time stock updates

### Stock Tracking

- Monitor stock movement
- Track inventory inflow and outflow
- View inventory history
- Review product-level stock activity

### Stock Adjustment

- Perform manual inventory corrections
- Record damaged stock
- Support inventory reconciliation
- Maintain adjustment history

### Procurement Management

- Manage supplier information
- Create and track purchase orders
- Monitor goods received
- Track procurement history
- Support inventory restocking workflows

### Sales and Orders Management

- Create and manage sales orders
- Track sales order status
- Manage customer information
- Track purchase orders
- Manage supplier information
- Monitor order progress

### AI Assistant

The AI Assistant is powered by Groq and provides AI-based support for inventory-related decisions.

It can assist with:

- Inventory insights
- Product recommendations
- Stock optimization suggestions
- Business-related inventory queries
- Stock trend analysis
- Replenishment-related decisions

### Audit Trail

StockOS maintains activity logs to improve traceability and accountability.

The audit system records:

- User actions
- Inventory modifications
- Stock adjustments
- System activities
- Inventory change history

